//Descriptions

#org @DESC_EVAPORATE
Nullifies all water to up SP. ATK.

#org @DESC_GRASS_DASH
GRASS-type moves hit first.

#org @DESC_SLIPPERY_TAIL
Tail moves hit first.

#org @DESC_DRILL_BEAK
Drill moves land critical hits.

#org @DESC_TEMPESTUOUS_SEA
Gains priority in rain.

#org @DESC_SHADOW_BOOST
GHOST-type moves hit first.

#org @DESC_BLAZE
Ups FIRE moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_TORRENT
Ups WATER moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_SWARM
Ups BUG moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_OVERGROW
Ups GRASS moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_VIRTUE
Ups NORMAL moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_OVERCHARGE
Ups ELECTRIC moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_SNOWFALL
Ups ICE moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_BRAINSTORM
Ups PSYCHIC moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_CYCLONE
Ups FLYING moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_BIOHAZARD
Ups POISON moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_RAMPAGE
Ups FIGHTING moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_UPHEAVAL
Ups GROUND moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_BEDROCK
Ups ROCK moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_WRATH
Ups DARK moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_HAUNTED
Ups GHOST moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_TEMPER
Ups STEEL moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_MYTHIC_RAGE
Ups DRAGON moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_ENCHANT
Ups FAIRY moves if below 33% HP.

#org @DESC_NORMAL_AURA
Powers up NORMAL-type moves.

#org @DESC_FIGHTING_AURA
Powers up FIGHTING-type moves.

