#org @DESC_WARFARE
NORMAL moves become FIGHTING.

#org @DESC_AERILATE
NORMAL moves become FLYING.

#org @DESC_TOXINATE
NORMAL moves become POISON.

#org @DESC_EARTHBOUND
NORMAL moves become GROUND.

#org @DESC_CRAGITATE
NORMAL moves become ROCK.

#org @DESC_INFECTATE
NORMAL moves become BUG.

#org @DESC_CHANNELING
NORMAL moves become GHOST.

#org @DESC_FORTIFIED
NORMAL moves become STEEL.

#org @DESC_EMPYREAL
NORMAL moves become FIRE.

#org @DESC_HYDRATE
NORMAL moves become WATER.

#org @DESC_NATURALIZE
NORMAL moves become GRASS.

#org @DESC_GALVANIZE
NORMAL moves become ELECTRIC.

#org @DESC_COGNITIVE
NORMAL moves become PSYCHIC.

#org @DESC_REFRIGERATE
NORMAL moves become ICE.

#org @DESC_WYVERNATE
NORMAL moves become DRAGON.

#org @DESC_ANTAGONIZE
NORMAL moves become DARK.

#org @DESC_PIXILATE
NORMAL moves become FAIRY.

#org @DESC_ELECTRIC_SURGE
Creates an electric terrain.

#org @DESC_GRASSY_SURGE
Creates a grassy terrain.

#org @DESC_MISTY_SURGE
Creates a misty terrain.

#org @DESC_PSYCHIC_SURGE
Creates a psychic terrain.

#org @DESC_MODULATOR
Sound moves become STEEL-type.

#org @DESC_WIZARDRY
Summons MAGIC ROOM on switch-in.

#org @DESC_MIRACULOUS
Summons WONDER ROOM on switch-in.

#org @DESC_WORMHOLE
Summons GRAVITY on switch-in.

#org @DESC_PLASMA_BURST
Disperses charged ions on switch-in.

#org @DESC_SHADOWY_SURGE
Creates a SHADOW TERRAIN.

#org @DESC_DRACO_SURGE
Creates a DRACO TERRAIN.